<div><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Key benefits</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container three-column-tile"><div class="row"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Improve reliability" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Improve reliability</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Powerful protection functions deliver robust safety. Conformal coating on electronic boards provides high availability and consistent performance in harsh conditions. Protect your critical infrastructure.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Simplify use for operators" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Simplify use for operators</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Handle devices and software easily with an intuitive design. Configure all functions as needed using the DIGSI 5 engineering tool to simplify management and reduce complexity for your team.</p></div></div></div><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="tile" data-ste-teaser-title="Maintain compliance" class="col-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4 tileHeightAdjust"><div class="tile-flex-wrapper"><h3 class="strong tileHeading">Maintain compliance</h3><div class="tileDescription"><p>Integrate your system securely with NERC CIP and BDEW Whitepaper compliant cybersecurity. Enjoy full IEC 61850 compatibility for trustworthy operations.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id='0pfKKtnhkgi0m56uhBVjU' class='sitesCardsContainer themed-component-wrapper' data-ste-section='cards-container_3' data-ste-section-id='0pfKKtnhkgi0m56uhBVjU'><is-land on:visible><div id="comp-0pfKKtnhkgi0m56uhBVjU" class="CardsContainer" data-component-type="CardsContainer"><section id="0pfKKtnhkgi0m56uhBVjU" class="cards-defaultBackground" role="region" aria-labelledby="section-heading-0pfKKtnhkgi0m56uhBVjU"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Featured capabilities</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div class="row cards-container-row"><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Flexible I/O with modular design" id="G_Flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20design-0" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20design-0-title" aria-describedby="G_Flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20design-0-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20design-0-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Flexible I/O with modular design</h3><div id="G_Flexible%20I%2FO%20with%20modular%20design-0-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Adjust the I/O structure in the SIPROTEC 5 modular system. Choose from 12 standard variants: 4/4 or 8/8 current/voltage transformers, 5-31 binary inputs and 8-46 binary outputs.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Precise short circuit detection" id="G_Precise%20short%20circuit%20detection-1" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Precise%20short%20circuit%20detection-1-title" aria-describedby="G_Precise%20short%20circuit%20detection-1-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Precise%20short%20circuit%20detection-1-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Precise short circuit detection</h3><div id="G_Precise%20short%20circuit%20detection-1-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Trip 3-pole short circuits in star, parallel and ring networks; identify ground faults in isolated or arc-suppression systems. Provide backup protection for differential on lines, transformers and generators.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div><div class="siemens-cards col-md-4"><div data-ste-element="teaser" data-ste-teaser-type="card" data-ste-teaser-title="Advanced communication and security" id="G_Advanced%20communication%20and%20security-2" class="card blogWrapNoLink rounded-0" role="article" aria-labelledby="G_Advanced%20communication%20and%20security-2-title" aria-describedby="G_Advanced%20communication%20and%20security-2-desc" tabindex="0"><div class="imageWrapper"></div><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column p-3"><strong class="text-kicker pb-2 mb-0 text-color"></strong><div class="category d-none">all</div><h3 id="G_Advanced%20communication%20and%20security-2-title" class="pb-4 mb-0">Advanced communication and security</h3><div id="G_Advanced%20communication%20and%20security-2-desc" class="text-black card-text pb-3 mb-0"><div><p>Use up to four pluggable communication modules for diverse, redundant protocols (IEC 61850, Modbus TCP) and reliable PRP/HSR data transmission. Implement robust cybersecurity with role-based access control and signed firmware.</p></div></div><div data-area="card-info-section" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-end h-100"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-a